      "message": "test(turning): pin G96/G97 mode switching across sections and the inch Tormach G96\n\nA lower tool clamp is lifted back to the machine's G50 before a later\nG97 section, a tool clamp over the machine's posts the machine's, and\nwith no machine maximum the tool's G50 carries into the G97 (commented\nin fanuc-lathe.cps: G50 S caps only under G96). An inch Tormach program\nposts Vc in ft/min with D in rpm.\n\nRefs #891\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
